  "description": "Gravel Racing, Redefined. The Kaius 01 is the result of BMC’s obsession with gravel speed. Engineered in the Impec Lab with cutting-edge carbon technology, it’s purpose-built for competitive gravel racing. Its race-optimized geometry delivers the ideal mix of stiffness, low weight, and compliance - enhancing traction, stability, and climbing efficiency across demanding terrain. With the full integrated ICS Carbon Aero cockpit, our Aerocore bottle cage design, this bike cuts through the wind and charges ahead. Equipped with top-tier components like the newest SRAM Force AXS XPLR, integrated power meters, and CG 39 carbon wheels, the Kaius 01 is ready to chase podiums and push boundaries on every ride.",
